# setuptools-scm puts every file git tracks in the source distribution.
# These stay in the repository and out of what is published to PyPI:
# working notes, and the reports of the MCP agent check (megabytes of
# traces of agent sessions, kept to compare releases).
prune dev
# The launcher of the MCP server is a distribution of its own.
prune packages
prune tools/mcp/agent_reports
